    "end_seconds": 268.79999999999995,
    "text": "more than one if you like to as well."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0134",
    "start_seconds": 267.68,
    "end_seconds": 270.76,
    "text": "And then, what do you want to expose it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0135",
    "start_seconds": 268.8,
    "end_seconds": 271.91900000000004,
    "text": "on and and what's the basic log output"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0136",
    "start_seconds": 270.76,
    "end_seconds": 274.28,
    "text": "level?"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0137",
    "start_seconds": 271.919,
    "end_seconds": 277.2,
    "text": "Uh when you'll see the the host spin up"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0138",
    "start_seconds": 274.28,
    "end_seconds": 279.79999999999995,
    "text": "itself, um what it does is it produces"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0139",
    "start_seconds": 277.2,
    "end_seconds": 281.08,
    "text": "an environment's identifier."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0140",
    "start_seconds": 279.8,
    "end_seconds": 282.68,
    "text": "We're just going to go ahead and copy"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0141",
    "start_seconds": 281.08,
    "end_seconds": 284.4,
    "text": "that. Uh in the future, we're going to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0142",
    "start_seconds": 282.68,
    "end_seconds": 286.68,
    "text": "make this even friendlier and easier to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0143",
    "start_seconds": 284.4,
    "end_seconds": 288.32,
    "text": "use, but for now, the environment ID"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0144",
    "start_seconds": 286.68,
    "end_seconds": 289.96,
    "text": "will be all that we need."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0145",
    "start_seconds": 288.32,
    "end_seconds": 290.919,
    "text": "And we now have a host running on this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0146",
    "start_seconds": 289.96,
    "end_seconds": 293.2,
    "text": "machine."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0147",
    "start_seconds": 290.919,
    "end_seconds": 294.68,
    "text": "Uh which doesn't mean much by itself,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0148",
    "start_seconds": 293.2,
    "end_seconds": 296.56,
    "text": "but when I actually come back to my"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0149",
    "start_seconds": 294.68,
    "end_seconds": 298.36,
    "text": "local machine, which I'll do over here"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0150",
    "start_seconds": 296.56,
    "end_seconds": 300.04,
    "text": "on this tab right here,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0151",
    "start_seconds": 298.36,
    "end_seconds": 302.56,
    "text": "I can actually just go right into the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0152",
    "start_seconds": 300.04,
    "end_seconds": 304.08000000000004,
    "text": "copilot CLI directly, which hopefully"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0153",
    "start_seconds": 302.56,
    "end_seconds": 305.12,
    "text": "you all are very familiar with at this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0154",
    "start_seconds": 304.08,
    "end_seconds": 307.03999999999996,
    "text": "point."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0155",
    "start_seconds": 305.12,
    "end_seconds": 310.12,
    "text": "Um we'll go ahead and turn it on, and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0156",
    "start_seconds": 307.04,
    "end_seconds": 312.91900000000004,
    "text": "then inside of uh upcoming builds,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0157",
    "start_seconds": 310.12,
    "end_seconds": 315.56,
    "text": "there's a /ahp command."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0158",
    "start_seconds": 312.919,
    "end_seconds": 317.59999999999997,
    "text": "Um what this allows you to do is connect"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0159",
    "start_seconds": 315.56,
    "end_seconds": 320.08,
    "text": "to hosts. It allows you to see sessions"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0160",
    "start_seconds": 317.6,
    "end_seconds": 321.91900000000004,
    "text": "across the hosts, restart them. Um"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0161",
    "start_seconds": 320.08,
    "end_seconds": 324.03999999999996,
    "text": "there's a few other exciting features"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0162",
    "start_seconds": 321.919,
    "end_seconds": 327.0,
    "text": "related to it as well, but to really"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0163",
    "start_seconds": 324.04,
    "end_seconds": 328.64000000000004,
    "text": "show off the core AHP concepts, what I'm"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0164",
    "start_seconds": 327.0,
    "end_seconds": 330.0,
    "text": "going to first do is just show you the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0165",
    "start_seconds": 328.64,
    "end_seconds": 332.28,
    "text": "host command."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0166",
    "start_seconds": 330.0,
    "end_seconds": 334.48,
    "text": "Um we are not attached to any host"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0167",
    "start_seconds": 332.28,
    "end_seconds": 336.64,
    "text": "currently. The copilot CLI hasn't been"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0168",
    "start_seconds": 334.48,
    "end_seconds": 339.24,
    "text": "configured to be connected to one."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0169",
    "start_seconds": 336.64,
    "end_seconds": 340.36,
    "text": "But what I can do is run an AHP cloud"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0170",
    "start_seconds": 339.24,
    "end_seconds": 342.919,
    "text": "command,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0171",
    "start_seconds": 340.36,
    "end_seconds": 344.96000000000004,
    "text": "give it the environment variable itself,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0172",
    "start_seconds": 342.919,
    "end_seconds": 347.35999999999996,
    "text": "and then if we flip back over to this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0173",
    "start_seconds": 344.96,
    "end_seconds": 349.64,
    "text": "AHP uh tab, we should see some"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0174",
    "start_seconds": 347.36,
    "end_seconds": 352.96000000000004,
    "text": "connections coming in as well."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0175",
    "start_seconds": 349.64,
    "end_seconds": 355.4,
    "text": "Um the nice thing is uh now I've bridged"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0176",
    "start_seconds": 352.96,
    "end_seconds": 357.79999999999995,
    "text": "essentially my local Copilot CLI"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0177",
    "start_seconds": 355.4,
    "end_seconds": 360.15999999999997,
    "text": "instance to the cloud uh through the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0178",
    "start_seconds": 357.8,
    "end_seconds": 362.0,
    "text": "cloud to my local machine, uh which is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0179",
    "start_seconds": 360.16,
    "end_seconds": 363.16,
    "text": "the Linux box that's currently sitting"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0180",
    "start_seconds": 362.0,
    "end_seconds": 365.92,
    "text": "at home."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0181",
    "start_seconds": 363.16,
    "end_seconds": 368.8,
    "text": "I can rerun the AHP hosts commands. You"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0182",
    "start_seconds": 365.92,
    "end_seconds": 371.04,
    "text": "can see that we are connected externally"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0183",
    "start_seconds": 368.8,
    "end_seconds": 374.08,
    "text": "through Copilot D. You get protocol"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0184",
    "start_seconds": 371.04,
    "end_seconds": 376.40000000000003,
    "text": "versions, environment IDs, etc. Um this"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0185",
    "start_seconds": 374.08,
    "end_seconds": 378.76,
    "text": "is showing that not only am I able to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0186",
    "start_seconds": 376.4,
    "end_seconds": 381.4,
    "text": "run Copilot uh locally, but we are"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0187",
    "start_seconds": 378.76,
    "end_seconds": 383.56,
    "text": "connected through uh my machine to my"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0188",
    "start_seconds": 381.4,
    "end_seconds": 385.88,
    "text": "external home machine as well."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0189",
    "start_seconds": 383.56,
    "end_seconds": 388.8,
    "text": "If I want to actually use that instead,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0190",
    "start_seconds": 385.88,
    "end_seconds": 389.84,
    "text": "I can simply run a {slash} AHP use"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0191",
    "start_seconds": 388.8,
    "end_seconds": 392.12,
    "text": "command."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0192",
    "start_seconds": 389.84,
    "end_seconds": 394.67999999999995,
    "text": "This will allow me to connect directly"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0193",
    "start_seconds": 392.12,
    "end_seconds": 397.16,
    "text": "to the machine. And it it will"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0194",
    "start_seconds": 394.68,
    "end_seconds": 399.32,
    "text": "essentially uh enable me to create new"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0195",
    "start_seconds": 397.16,
    "end_seconds": 400.56,
    "text": "sessions. It'll also allow me to attach,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0196",
    "start_seconds": 399.32,
    "end_seconds": 402.84,
    "text": "which I'll show you some of that that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0197",
    "start_seconds": 400.56,
    "end_seconds": 406.24,
    "text": "fun flexibility in a second here."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0198",
    "start_seconds": 402.84,
    "end_seconds": 409.03999999999996,
    "text": "Uh if we want to start a new session, um"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0199",
    "start_seconds": 406.24,
    "end_seconds": 410.72,
    "text": "we can just do {slash} AHP new."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0200",
    "start_seconds": 409.04,
    "end_seconds": 413.20000000000005,
    "text": "This will uh"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0201",
    "start_seconds": 410.72,
    "end_seconds": 415.88000000000005,
    "text": "update my interface to actually reflect"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0202",
    "start_seconds": 413.2,
    "end_seconds": 418.28,
    "text": "the remote host instead. And so similar"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0203",
    "start_seconds": 415.88,
    "end_seconds": 420.919,
    "text": "to the path that I showed you for my"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0204",
    "start_seconds": 418.28,
    "end_seconds": 422.84,
    "text": "workspace folder, this is not actually"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0205",
    "start_seconds": 420.919,
    "end_seconds": 424.919,
    "text": "anymore a a directory on my local"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0206",
    "start_seconds": 422.84,
    "end_seconds": 427.35999999999996,
    "text": "machine. This is actually spun up a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0207",
    "start_seconds": 424.919,
    "end_seconds": 429.44,
    "text": "runtime on my local Linux server at"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0208",
    "start_seconds": 427.36,
    "end_seconds": 431.56,
    "text": "home. It's set the current working"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0209",
    "start_seconds": 429.44,
    "end_seconds": 435.04,
    "text": "directory to the workspace folder that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0210",
    "start_seconds": 431.56,
    "end_seconds": 437.4,
    "text": "I'm running the AHP host uh on directly."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0211",
    "start_seconds": 435.04,
    "end_seconds": 440.04,
    "text": "And I can go ahead and interface with"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0212",
    "start_seconds": 437.4,
    "end_seconds": 441.919,
    "text": "the agent directly on that machine. Um"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0213",
    "start_seconds": 440.04,
    "end_seconds": 444.12,
    "text": "one of the huge benefits of this again"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0214",
    "start_seconds": 441.919,
    "end_seconds": 446.28,
    "text": "is that even though the runtime is"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0215",
    "start_seconds": 444.12,
    "end_seconds": 448.48,
    "text": "running elsewhere, these really thin"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0216",
    "start_seconds": 446.28,
    "end_seconds": 450.52,
    "text": "external clients, whether it's the CLI,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0217",
    "start_seconds": 448.48,
    "end_seconds": 452.88,
    "text": "whether it's VS Code, uh the GitHub"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0218",
    "start_seconds": 450.52,
    "end_seconds": 454.56,
    "text": "Copilot app, or any other client you'd"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0219",
    "start_seconds": 452.88,
    "end_seconds": 457.44,
    "text": "like to build uh that aligns with the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0220",
    "start_seconds": 454.56,
    "end_seconds": 459.64,
    "text": "protocol, can access this uh interface,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0221",
    "start_seconds": 457.44,
    "end_seconds": 462.44,
    "text": "can connect to the system, and can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0222",
    "start_seconds": 459.64,
    "end_seconds": 464.56,
    "text": "actually drive the agentic session. Um"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0223",
    "start_seconds": 462.44,
    "end_seconds": 466.76,
    "text": "but it doesn't really just stop there."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0224",
    "start_seconds": 464.56,
    "end_seconds": 468.76,
    "text": "Uh, some of the unique capabilities that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0225",
    "start_seconds": 466.76,
    "end_seconds": 471.08,
    "text": "come with something like this uh that"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0226",
    "start_seconds": 468.76,
    "end_seconds": 472.8,
    "text": "represent a really nice addition to our"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0227",
    "start_seconds": 471.08,
    "end_seconds": 475.08,
    "text": "remoting technology"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0228",
    "start_seconds": 472.8,
    "end_seconds": 477.04,
    "text": "is you're able to attach multiple"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0229",
    "start_seconds": 475.08,
    "end_seconds": 479.8,
    "text": "sessions at the same time."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0230",
    "start_seconds": 477.04,
    "end_seconds": 483.28000000000003,
    "text": "Um, so if I go ahead and"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0231",
    "start_seconds": 479.8,
    "end_seconds": 484.48,
    "text": "add the AHP host onto this client as"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0232",
    "start_seconds": 483.28,
    "end_seconds": 486.47999999999996,
    "text": "well,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0233",
    "start_seconds": 484.48,
    "end_seconds": 489.88,
    "text": "I run a different command. So, take a"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0234",
    "start_seconds": 486.48,
    "end_seconds": 489.88,
    "text": "look at the sessions. Oops."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0235",
    "start_seconds": 491.36,
    "end_seconds": 496.0,
    "text": "Oops."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0236",
    "start_seconds": 493.88,
    "end_seconds": 497.84,
    "text": "Helps if I add it at the end."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0237",
    "start_seconds": 496.0,
    "end_seconds": 500.36,
    "text": "You'll see that there is an active"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0238",
    "start_seconds": 497.84,
    "end_seconds": 501.64,
    "text": "session, which is this E39."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0239",
    "start_seconds": 500.36,
    "end_seconds": 504.64,
    "text": "You'll see the OnePlus One, which"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0240",
    "start_seconds": 501.64,
    "end_seconds": 507.44,
    "text": "matches my prompt, showing that uh I can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0241",
    "start_seconds": 504.64,
    "end_seconds": 511.44,
    "text": "actually uh attach to that session"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0242",
    "start_seconds": 507.44,
    "end_seconds": 515.32,
    "text": "directly. So, if I use AHP attach,"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0243",
    "start_seconds": 511.44,
    "end_seconds": 517.159,
    "text": "we copy this identifier right here."
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0244",
    "start_seconds": 515.32,
    "end_seconds": 519.36,
    "text": "We should be able to bridge our sessions"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0245",
    "start_seconds": 517.159,
    "end_seconds": 521.84,
    "text": "together. Uh, if you've used our"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0246",
    "start_seconds": 519.36,
    "end_seconds": 524.2,
    "text": "remoting technology before, uh typically"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0247",
    "start_seconds": 521.84,
    "end_seconds": 526.0400000000001,
    "text": "it was pull-based. It was really forcing"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0248",
    "start_seconds": 524.2,
    "end_seconds": 528.08,
    "text": "you into a situation where you could"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0249",
    "start_seconds": 526.04,
    "end_seconds": 531.64,
    "text": "have one active clients uh that could"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0250",
    "start_seconds": 528.08,
    "end_seconds": 533.48,
    "text": "steer the session itself. Now you get uh"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0251",
    "start_seconds": 531.64,
    "end_seconds": 536.28,
    "text": "more advanced capabilities when it comes"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0252",
    "start_seconds": 533.48,
    "end_seconds": 538.08,
    "text": "to real-time replayability. Um, you get"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0253",
    "start_seconds": 536.28,
    "end_seconds": 540.04,
    "text": "advanced capabilities when it comes to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0254",
    "start_seconds": 538.08,
    "end_seconds": 542.1600000000001,
    "text": "the playback systems and how sessions"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0255",
    "start_seconds": 540.04,
    "end_seconds": 544.28,
    "text": "can be portable across clients. And what"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0256",
    "start_seconds": 542.16,
    "end_seconds": 546.56,
    "text": "this really translates to"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0257",
    "start_seconds": 544.28,
    "end_seconds": 548.3199999999999,
    "text": "is you get live updates across clients"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0258",
    "start_seconds": 546.56,
    "end_seconds": 551.2399999999999,
    "text": "as well. As you see, I typed in one"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0259",
    "start_seconds": 548.32,
    "end_seconds": 553.08,
    "text": "client 2 + 3. As soon as I hit enter, it"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0260",
    "start_seconds": 551.24,
    "end_seconds": 555.6800000000001,
    "text": "can go to the other client, too. You can"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0261",
    "start_seconds": 553.08,
    "end_seconds": 557.5600000000001,
    "text": "see the response on both. Um, our core"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0262",
    "start_seconds": 555.68,
    "end_seconds": 559.1999999999999,
    "text": "objective and goal is to make sure as"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0263",
    "start_seconds": 557.56,
    "end_seconds": 561.64,
    "text": "you bridge new clients into the"
  },
  {
    "segment_id": "yt-0264",
